alls below 20%%%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当生命值降低到20%%%s时，进入暴走。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c490cad164e57043ec638a88b88d5d73f596b99b5685f6ebc99f1174f9eb289e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"537b4ea7b9cb72a4a15ddc5ca2e4d2c42bce63f1a1e96b967bd896f18e89f3ab","logical_entry_identity":"14d7ffc72d8cd9b689ac0f7969da6dbbfea49b902e1e430cf0540251fe1efcca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"WHY AREN'T WOMEN ATTRACTED TO ME I'M A NICE %s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"为什么女人就是不被我吸引呢？我明明是个大好%s啊。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"843acfe01e2ccacacf964367eca14f2a73c1c3d48192f42ff79112d3ba7f94be","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"537f45fe115a36862c6e9d76963b418b76ca435f37b69b628c2023bdd4623bc8","logical_entry_identity":"85c55f35504f22ab006b6be51ef86605611b1051180c2221c12b08038f5617bb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Free Action","source_tag":"_t","target":"-自由行动"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dc70f9c37e96b1cd0ba7cb2945396b0ee895e37af012ceb3f697565098a9f017","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5382c13891e7824a885bcc687655966b71582897257f5903766c17632b10eb1b","logical_entry_identity":"f1cf3cde0ea8da474cd605869c37ab41bc20df9bf4a9fc518a0b29074160ab4b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"[Reset]","source_tag":"_t","target":"[重置]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"93da6365afd41dd375056bd1ee99c7f05fde81ad6de83e933bf87e79ce46a0f9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5385c21ff123ba4b3cc9ce69ab7d179d245edac29b4f3410ba7c402eec883b2e","logical_entry_identity":"df15d72563b3b6d7042f838c558fbbc18f2d2627ab45c08a0d1b91cb6aac9a59","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Breathe poison on your foes, doing %d damage over a few turns.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Magic.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"对你的敌人喷吐毒雾，在几个回合内造成 %d 点伤害。伤害受魔力值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6322492bdf6b4b7e0e1294ad68d1a3ca4ccb7365f9d701e86a586b3aa002f96","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5389e3dd09850f78621e07a275d061287b547ed772874b2f146f4fc382be52fa","logical_entry_identity":"6c5ed96e66e95174e01b81108775453932f56142a136bf098a89d9b2880a5cc3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spellpower increased by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"法术强度增加 %d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"31d62f64752b8e2604476339efd20858d3ff4abf4f1a3d7da49c96ba3a115a1f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"538afe4dac14b2e056dd801e5e29e48b1a00107853f3e32441d91155b3e2cd71","logical_entry_identity":"73f1fd6f1a468aa7f01b80b2675b87f5d4efa54366a66a398964e1feeabc85ea","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I fell asleep in a dark hollow, but my sleep was troubled by terrible dreams. The dreams are so vivid in my mind!\n\nI saw the red star, and it became a land of fire floating in the night sky, full of black creatures with yellow eyes and hungry red mouths. And beyond the red star, far beyond was a dim world, but fractured and split all about its surface. As the world spun the split continents crushed against each other, and lava spilled up, and lands sunk into the ground. Demonic mouths screamed up as they disappeared into fiery death. It was if the world was tearing itself apart, but some force of will was desperately trying to keep it held together.\n\nAnd I saw then in the centre of the world, as it spun and crumpled and crunched, a vast figure with a horned head and outstretched limbs and shining white eyes. It held tight to the innards of the world, holding it together against forces threatening to pull the whole planet apart. The giant face contorted and screamed in pain and fury.\n\n“Urh'Rok,” a deep voice spoke within my head. “Our god, our saviour, holder of our world. In the name of Urh'Rok we seek vengeance against Amakthel and the Sher'Tul. The petty world of Eyal shall fall!” And then I woke up, and I felt sure something was nearby, looking for me. I fled instantly.\n\nAm I going mad? The name “Urh'Rok” still rebounds through my skull and my vision is dimmed. Perhaps I have been wearing this ring too long...\n\nYes, yes, this is all clearly an illusion! A strange nightmare that I shall wake up from. I shall take the ring off, and go visit the lovely moonstone again. Once I see the stars all shall be well...","source_tag":"_t","target":"我在一片黑暗的山洞中渐渐睡去，但是我的睡眠被一个可怕的梦吵醒了。即使刚睡醒的脑袋仍然一团浆糊，那个梦仍然在我的脑海中异常清晰。\n\n我看到眼前红色的星星越来越大，原来，那是一片在夜空中漂浮着的燃烧的大陆，上面满是有着黄色眼睛和贪婪的红色大嘴的黑色生物。在红色星星的上方遥远的地方是一片黑暗的世界，但是那个世界似乎被某种力量切得支离破碎。在这个世界旋转的过程中，破碎的大陆互相撞击，岩浆的波浪浮浮沉沉，陆地沉入地底。我听到恶魔般的吼叫，那是大陆上的生物被烈火吞没时的绝望呻吟。似乎这个世界被完全撕裂开来，但是某种意志的力量努力试图将他们固定在一起。\n\n视野中，随着这个世界逐渐旋转，逐渐被挤压碎裂，我隐约能看到那个世界的中心。在那里，是一个拥有闪烁的白色眼睛，头上长角的巨大影像。它向外伸展而出的强壮四肢紧紧抓着世界的核心，试图将它连结在一起，来对抗那些不断将这颗星球撕裂的可怕力量。在剧烈的痛苦和愤怒中，巨人的表情被其扭曲，发出怒吼。\n\n“乌鲁洛克，”一个深沉的声音在我的脑海中响起。“我们的神，我们的救世主，保护世界之人。以乌鲁洛克的名义，我们将向阿马克泰尔和夏·图尔人复仇。渺小的埃亚尔世界终将陨落！”我被噩梦所惊醒，我的直觉告诉我周围某种东西正凝望着我，让我撒腿就跑。\n\n是我的脑子出了什么问题吗？那个奇怪的名字，“乌鲁洛克”仍然在我的心头回响，我的视野也变得昏暗起来。大概是我戴了这个戒指太久了的副作用的缘故……\n\n唉，对，这一定是我的幻觉！我早该从这个怪梦里醒来了。我应该赶紧脱下这个该死的戒指，回去看看我可爱的月亮石们。只要能让我看见美丽的星空，一切都一定会好起来的……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8f22769e80339450b174d991e5eb07b788434202454b09a78cb013f8eaf2329","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"538daf9524794ca39a94addd2b1b2f0ada0a8c7c87e1234270701fc275b71902","logical_entry_identity":"ac18b28346a4d52efe1b113a1b239e1d4ceaade5d0ce47afcb6ed38d29d4a8b0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Balance","source_tag":"talent name","target":"唯我论：均衡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"923119cce95b7b3ae4cbaedc37c4054b3b3d17efc1029cc39cd5b6bc768bf51e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5390a65ac1bdf3d2db1319a5e46c6677d67b97dbfb96693d765f76086f0a7fe0","logical_entry_identity":"9a7fcf9aab4da6058fd0a071cb25b15722d10597d76746fabca8ef466041a763","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and absorbed into nightmares forever","source_tag":"_t","target":"并被困于永恒的噩梦中"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e6b5e7a389adb1332d0f8d626bd41a7722a774337bbe87494a0316a0f1cc4154","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"539117486b81ff38e04fa1c4caf656c3dac0c6612a01d4d83badef7b45a3c9ad","logical_entry_identity":"c68dd16f1d9f2095dc7a47f39ef30025b8bbc1c5df6a7c93407e54ccaf872f51","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Become of the master of flesh, creating ghoul minions to do your bidding","source_tag":"_t","target":"成为血肉之主，创造食尸鬼军团来执行你的命令。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"24dc83bc89f03d97f6f70a4bfbc538df90cc06200851cbc5dcbb3b81fe38be58","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5391c12c3f4a431883c11bd37648c197ff86e9f7c8eeb48358b7b62f7f3c89cd","logical_entry_identity":"420612549f411339e19a03197d2ebf903cc9973eef04772b657db054606fa905","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have been contacted by a sentient star, far away from Eyal. It wants to help you on your journey!\n\nYou have unlocked the #LIGHT_GREEN#Avatar of a Distant Sun class evolution#WHITE# for Sun Paladins.\n\nFeatures:\n- #GOLD#Wield a two-handed weapon and a shield together#LAST#\n- 50% of all damage dealt is converted to #GOLD#light damage#LAST#\n- #GOLD#Gravitic Effulgence#LAST#: whenever Weapon of Light hits the damage is now a radius 2 sphere and all foes in range 5 are drawn to it\n- The damage and chance to trigger of #GOLD#Searing Sight#LAST# is doubled\n- Whenever #GOLD#Sun's Vengeance#LAST# triggers the remaining cooldown of Judgement is reduced by 6\n- Interacts with #GOLD#Irresistible Sun#LAST#\n\nClass evolutions are selected as prodigies and grant new ways to build and expand your class and are only visible to the concerned class.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"一颗远离埃亚尔、拥有意识的星辰联系了你。它想在旅途中帮助你！\n\n你现在解锁了太阳骑士的 #LIGHT_GREEN#日耀神使职业进阶#WHITE#。\n\n特性：\n- #GOLD#可以同时装备双手武器和盾牌#LAST#\n- 50% 伤害转化为 #GOLD#光系伤害#LAST#\n- #GOLD#光辉引力#LAST#：每当光明之刃命中时，其伤害变为半径2的球形伤害，且将5格范围内的所有敌人拉过来。\n- #GOLD#灼热之视#LAST# 的伤害和触发概率翻倍\n- #GOLD#阳光之怒#LAST# 触发时，裁决的剩余冷却时间减少6回合。\n- 与#GOLD#无御之日#LAST#联动。\n\n职业进阶是一种觉醒技，它们可以给予你新的方法来强化你的职业。只有相关的职业才能看到它们。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c200478fab143fc7d11dc80d77cf760e59d8300e3830092d30845b86b9f0b4f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"539a41b58cbb04e5cda952479c0c5ecbf00e9a548008b5badbdc09cdec123d7a","logical_entry_identity":"e41a00fc78f6b578cff75a46bdfe83f8be6367e8b889390b045b4c927b88e916","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The world grows old as you stand through the ages. To you, time is different.\n\t\tReduces the time remaining on detrimental effects by %d, most cooling down talents by %d, and increases the time remaining on beneficial effects by %d (up to 2 times the current duration).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"世界在不断的变老，而你似乎永恒不变。对于你来说，时间是不同寻常的。\n\t\t减少 %d 回合负面状态的持续时间，减少技能 %d 回合冷却时间直至冷却并增加 %d 回合增益状态的持续时间（至多延长为剩余时间的两倍）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7159dba7cd46e222d93ec82db190e95c215ce8a8b684d51bbcf206600195fbf6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"539aaf805738cec8ee1c520bad38fe61c28fa43de72f38e68964ca8266e02bba","logical_entry_identity":"ecb6e1168246249f1b5434097f8e793a1d4e3ce1727774831f89e56f70fba668","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#DARK_GREEN##Source# shares damage with %s oozes!","source_tag":"delayedLogMessage","target":"#DARK_GREEN##Source#和%s软泥怪平分伤害！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"19dbc15e098d75db5463c698aa16b5e92a3ad26d3bea4554a027cef5ee39fd37","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"53a0fbfac772582c92a8ee6eb3f63efd855f9634fc0c92e079446f4749efabd1","logical_entry_identity":"dc00287f97a4ec12460f08710415d0da66ab69458c85f76e504dd2d2a6bfc83f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Venomous","source_tag":"_t","target":"剧毒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"310c412ff04bf1dc25ffe40c931b15ef74ad1f4e7c7edd20b3f5d5e86a976ba9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"53a280745c9fcea310dce58c545261dcb0f5f699494e196acfe6a2aa9e1708fb","logical_entry_identity":"0de94eb57549a8b6b16aa2578257f0c594bd936ce5b9bbe775741395e334f59b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"quiver of dragonbone arrows","source_tag":"entity name","target":"一袋龙骨箭矢"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f4a0c3e2a1900191